        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: "A note about conditions: \nConditions can have more complex logic
          than \nvariable conditions (although both still have scripts associated
          with them. \nConditions are opted for in many cases here due to needing
          \nto access information about external objects, but not consistently \nto
          the point that it'd make sense to store it on the blackboard. "
